          "title": "Orthogonal Force Vector Components",
          "problemStatement": "A force of magnitude 50 N acts at an angle of 60 degrees to the positive x-axis. Find its x and y components.",
          "stepByStepSolution": [
            "Step 1: Given F = 50 N, theta = 60 degrees.",
            "Step 2: Calculate Fx = F * cos(60 deg) = 50 * 0.5 = 25.0 N.",
            "Step 3: Calculate Fy = F * sin(60 deg) = 50 * (sqrt(3)/2) = 43.30 N."
          ],
          "finalAnswer": "Fx = 25.0 N, Fy = 43.30 N",
